1
00:00:02,342 --> 00:00:03,801
KATARA: Water...

2
00:00:04,719 --> 00:00:05,887
Earth...

3
00:00:06,638 --> 00:00:07,847
Fire...

4
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,225
Air.

5
00:00:11,184 --> 00:00:14,979
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,188 --> 00:00:19,234
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,442 --> 00:00:23,404
Only the Avatar, master of
all four elements, could stop them.

8
00:00:23,696 --> 00:00:27,116
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

9
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,787
100 years passed and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar...

10
00:00:31,079 --> 00:00:32,830
An Airbender named Aang.

11
00:00:33,039 --> 00:00:35,083
And although his
airbending skills are great,

12
00:00:35,291 --> 00:00:37,710
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

13
00:00:37,794 --> 00:00:38,962
AANG: Oof!

14
00:00:39,045 --> 00:00:41,714
But I believe Aang can save the world.

15
00:00:41,923 --> 00:00:44,259
( ♪ )

16
00:00:48,012 --> 00:00:50,515
( MAN READING )

17
00:00:51,099 --> 00:00:53,518
OZAI: You have redeemed yourself, my son.

18
00:00:54,602 --> 00:00:56,145
Welcome home.

19
00:00:56,312 --> 00:00:58,439
MAI: I know one thing I care about.

20
00:00:58,773 --> 00:01:00,650
I care about you.

21
00:01:02,485 --> 00:01:04,320
SOKKA: A solar eclipse is coming.

22
00:01:04,404 --> 00:01:06,781
The sun will be entirely
blocked out by the moon

23
00:01:06,864 --> 00:01:09,325
and the firebenders will be helpless.

24
00:01:09,409 --> 00:01:11,995
That's the day we need to invade
the Fire Nation.

25
00:01:12,078 --> 00:01:13,746
The day of black sun.

26
00:01:13,955 --> 00:01:16,624
I've always known that I would
have to face the Fire Lord.

27
00:01:16,708 --> 00:01:19,627
But now I know I need to do it alone.

28
00:01:19,711 --> 00:01:22,964
( ♪ )

29
00:01:31,681 --> 00:01:33,808
( APPA GROANS )

30
00:01:33,891 --> 00:01:34,976
( MOMO CHATTERS )

31
00:01:35,059 --> 00:01:38,313
This is it, the official rendezvous
point for the invasion force.

32
00:01:38,396 --> 00:01:40,607
TOPH: How did you pick this place?

33
00:01:40,690 --> 00:01:43,568
SOKKA: Before we split up, my dad and I
found this island on a map.

34
00:01:43,651 --> 00:01:45,737
It's uninhabited,
and the harbor surrounded by cliffs

35
00:01:45,820 --> 00:01:47,655
seemed like the perfect secluded place.

36
00:01:47,739 --> 00:01:49,240
KATARA: Nice choice, Sokka.

37
00:01:49,324 --> 00:01:51,034
And we're here four days
ahead of schedule.

38
00:01:51,117 --> 00:01:53,202
Wait, four days?

39
00:01:53,328 --> 00:01:56,247
The invasion's in four days? Ugh!

40
00:01:56,331 --> 00:01:57,915
( YAWNS )

41
00:01:57,999 --> 00:02:00,543
Whatever, that's, like,
four days from now.

42
00:02:00,627 --> 00:02:02,420
Let's just calm down and...

43
00:02:02,503 --> 00:02:04,505
( SNORING )

44
00:02:04,964 --> 00:02:06,674
Sokka's got the right idea, Aang.

45
00:02:06,758 --> 00:02:08,509
We're here, we're ready.

46
00:02:08,593 --> 00:02:12,055
The best thing we can do now
is get plenty of rest.

47
00:02:12,388 --> 00:02:14,223
( GROANS ) I guess.

48
00:02:34,035 --> 00:02:36,579
AANG: Your days of tyranny
are over, Fire Lord.

49
00:02:36,663 --> 00:02:39,248
I'm bringing you down.

50
00:02:39,332 --> 00:02:41,167
Really?

51
00:02:41,250 --> 00:02:43,544
How do you plan on doing that

52
00:02:43,628 --> 00:02:46,381
when you're not even wearing pants?

53
00:02:46,464 --> 00:02:47,715
( YELLS )

54
00:02:47,799 --> 00:02:49,634
Oh, no.

55
00:02:57,558 --> 00:03:00,395
( CACKLING )

56
00:03:05,525 --> 00:03:07,235
( GASPS )

57
00:03:07,318 --> 00:03:09,195
( GRUNTING )

58
00:03:09,278 --> 00:03:10,488
( SIGHS )

59
00:03:10,655 --> 00:03:11,823
( MOMO CHATTERS )

60
00:03:11,906 --> 00:03:13,741
It was just a dream, Momo.

61
00:03:13,825 --> 00:03:15,618
I still have my pants.

62
00:03:15,702 --> 00:03:17,161
( CHATTERING )

63
00:03:17,245 --> 00:03:19,497
Well, I better keep training.

64
00:03:27,004 --> 00:03:28,297
( CHATTERS )

65
00:03:35,596 --> 00:03:38,015
Fresh fruit, Prince Zuko?

66
00:03:38,266 --> 00:03:40,685
May I wash your feet, sir?

67
00:03:40,935 --> 00:03:42,562
Head massage?

68
00:03:43,229 --> 00:03:44,647
Hot towel?

69
00:03:55,491 --> 00:03:57,577
( CROWD CHEERING )

70
00:03:57,660 --> 00:04:01,956
( GIRLS LAUGHING )

71
00:04:02,290 --> 00:04:04,500
( LAUGHING )

72
00:04:04,584 --> 00:04:05,877
Oh...

73
00:04:06,210 --> 00:04:08,171
Prince Zuko, is something wrong?

74
00:04:08,254 --> 00:04:09,964
You didn't take the palanquin.

75
00:04:10,047 --> 00:04:12,425
I'm just going to Mai's house,
it's not far.

76
00:04:12,508 --> 00:04:15,428
It's not a prince's place
to walk anywhere, sir.

77
00:04:34,697 --> 00:04:37,450
( THUDDING )

78
00:04:51,506 --> 00:04:54,050
Hey, how long have you been up?

79
00:04:54,133 --> 00:04:55,635
A couple hours.

80
00:04:55,718 --> 00:04:58,971
I got a lot more skills to
refine if I'm gonna fight Ozai.

81
00:04:59,055 --> 00:05:02,391
KATARA: You know,
there is such a thing as over training.

82
00:05:02,892 --> 00:05:05,228
( GRUNTING )

83
00:05:12,235 --> 00:05:13,402
You don't get it, do you?

84
00:05:13,486 --> 00:05:17,698
My form is bad, I'm sloppy,
and I still don't know any firebending.

85
00:05:17,782 --> 00:05:19,408
Not even the basics.

86
00:05:21,285 --> 00:05:24,372
That's okay, Aang, the eclipse will
block all firebending anyway.

87
00:05:24,455 --> 00:05:25,873
You don't need to know any.

88
00:05:25,957 --> 00:05:27,542
Plus, it's a stupid element.

89
00:05:27,625 --> 00:05:30,294
Okay, well, I still have to
work on everything else.

90
00:05:30,378 --> 00:05:32,630
I better spend the whole day training.

91
00:05:51,607 --> 00:05:53,025
( YAWNS )

92
00:05:53,109 --> 00:05:54,151
AANG: Good night, Katara.

93
00:05:54,569 --> 00:05:55,903
Good night, Sokka.

94
00:05:55,987 --> 00:05:57,780
Good night, Toph.

95
00:05:58,030 --> 00:06:00,408
Good night, Appa, good night, Momo.

96
00:06:00,533 --> 00:06:01,909
Good night, Appa and Mo...

97
00:06:01,993 --> 00:06:03,327
Go to sleep, already.

98
00:06:15,381 --> 00:06:17,884
( SNAPS FINGERS )

99
00:06:22,305 --> 00:06:24,724
Your days of tyranny
are over, Fire Lord.

100
00:06:24,807 --> 00:06:26,809
I'm bringing you down.

101
00:06:26,893 --> 00:06:30,479
And this time I brought pants.

102
00:06:30,813 --> 00:06:32,607
So it seems.

103
00:06:32,690 --> 00:06:36,819
But are you prepared
for your mathematics test?

104
00:06:36,903 --> 00:06:38,738
Math test?

105
00:06:38,821 --> 00:06:41,574
Oh, no, I forgot all about the math test.

106
00:06:41,657 --> 00:06:43,075
( OZAI CACKLING )

107
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:46,412
( AANG SCREAMS )

108
00:06:46,913 --> 00:06:48,372
( GASPING )

109
00:06:48,456 --> 00:06:50,166
I've got to be ready.

110
00:06:59,342 --> 00:07:01,469
Aang, it's the middle of the night.

111
00:07:01,719 --> 00:07:03,679
You need to go back to sleep.

112
00:07:03,763 --> 00:07:06,641
But I forgot my pants and my math test.

113
00:07:07,433 --> 00:07:10,478
( SIGHS )

114
00:07:11,395 --> 00:07:13,189
Aang, sleep.

115
00:07:13,481 --> 00:07:15,650
Please, for me.

116
00:07:25,701 --> 00:07:27,870
( SHEEP BAAS )

117
00:07:27,954 --> 00:07:30,498
Tell me, if you could have
anything you wanted right now

118
00:07:30,581 --> 00:07:32,041
what would it be?

119
00:07:32,124 --> 00:07:36,587
Hmm... A big fancy fruit tart
with rose petals on top.

120
00:07:36,671 --> 00:07:40,549
You know, being a prince and all,
I might just be able to make that happen.

121
00:07:40,967 --> 00:07:43,761
( LAUGHS ) That would be impressive.

122
00:07:44,428 --> 00:07:47,264
Do you think you can find
a fresh fruit tart for the lady?

123
00:07:47,348 --> 00:07:48,724
With rose petals on top?

124
00:07:48,808 --> 00:07:51,102
Excellent choice, sir.

125
00:07:51,185 --> 00:07:54,188
I guess there are some nice perks
that come with being royalty.

126
00:07:54,313 --> 00:07:56,524
Though there's annoying stuff too.

127
00:07:56,607 --> 00:07:58,985
Like that all-day war meeting coming up.

128
00:07:59,110 --> 00:08:01,445
War meeting, what are you talking about?

129
00:08:01,570 --> 00:08:02,822
Azula mentioned something.

130
00:08:03,114 --> 00:08:05,408
I, I assumed you were going too.

131
00:08:05,491 --> 00:08:08,327
I guess I wasn't invited.

132
00:08:11,998 --> 00:08:13,874
OZAI: Wake up, Aang.

133
00:08:14,083 --> 00:08:15,710
Wake up, sleepyhead.

134
00:08:17,294 --> 00:08:19,046
Rise and shine.

135
00:08:19,130 --> 00:08:20,923
You overslept.

136
00:08:21,007 --> 00:08:22,508
You missed the invasion.

137
00:08:22,883 --> 00:08:25,428
( CACKLING )

138
00:08:31,058 --> 00:08:33,686
Sokka, get up, I need to know
what day it is.

139
00:08:33,769 --> 00:08:35,563
What, who's talking?

140
00:08:35,646 --> 00:08:36,814
Ow.

141
00:08:38,107 --> 00:08:42,028
Relax, it's still two days
before the invasion.

142
00:08:42,528 --> 00:08:45,031
Sokka, you've got to get up
and drill your rock-climbing exercises.

143
00:08:45,156 --> 00:08:46,407
What?

144
00:08:46,866 --> 00:08:49,785
In one of my dreams, you were
running from Fire Nation soldiers

145
00:08:49,869 --> 00:08:51,287
trying to climb this cliff.

146
00:08:51,370 --> 00:08:53,122
But you were too slow and they got you.

147
00:08:53,456 --> 00:08:56,208
But that was just a dream,
I'm a great climber.

148
00:08:56,333 --> 00:08:59,295
Then climb that cliff, climb it fast.

149
00:09:07,178 --> 00:09:10,890
Stupid Avatar, stupid cliff, stupid dream.

150
00:09:10,973 --> 00:09:12,308
I can climb fast.

151
00:09:14,310 --> 00:09:16,437
- Don't drink that!
-( SOKKA SCREAMS )

152
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:18,647
Why, is it poisoned?

153
00:09:18,898 --> 00:09:21,358
In my dream, we were right
in the middle of the invasion

154
00:09:21,525 --> 00:09:23,819
and you had to stop
to use the bathroom.

155
00:09:23,903 --> 00:09:25,946
We died because of your
tiny bladder.

156
00:09:26,030 --> 00:09:28,074
And you need to start
wearing your hair up.

157
00:09:28,157 --> 00:09:30,826
In my dream, your hair
got caught in a train and...

158
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:32,745
Aang, I know you're just
trying to help.

159
00:09:32,828 --> 00:09:34,413
But you really need to get a grip.

160
00:09:34,872 --> 00:09:35,956
You're unraveling.

161
00:09:36,248 --> 00:09:38,334
( SIGHS )

162
00:09:38,626 --> 00:09:41,462
You're right, I'm losing my mind.

163
00:09:43,756 --> 00:09:45,216
( SCREAMS )

164
00:09:50,221 --> 00:09:52,264
It's like every time I think
about how stressed I am,

165
00:09:52,348 --> 00:09:54,058
I just end up more stressed.

166
00:09:54,350 --> 00:09:56,519
I'm like a big growing snowball of nerves.

167
00:09:56,602 --> 00:09:58,270
Of course you are.

168
00:09:58,354 --> 00:10:01,482
That's 'cause you gotta fight the
Fire Lord, the baddest man on the planet.

169
00:10:01,565 --> 00:10:03,776
And you better win,
or we're all done for.

170
00:10:03,859 --> 00:10:05,236
Sokka, you're not helping.

171
00:10:05,319 --> 00:10:06,779
What?

172
00:10:06,862 --> 00:10:09,073
It's true, that's the deal, he knows it.

173
00:10:10,699 --> 00:10:12,785
( WHIMPERING )

174
00:10:12,868 --> 00:10:14,912
You know what, I've got just the thing.

175
00:10:14,995 --> 00:10:17,873
Get ready to be de-stressified.

176
00:10:21,293 --> 00:10:24,797
These yoga stretches can really work
wonders if you do them in extreme heat.

177
00:10:25,506 --> 00:10:26,924
Reach up.

178
00:10:27,091 --> 00:10:29,093
Reach for the sun.

179
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:32,638
Feel your chi paths clearing.

180
00:10:34,140 --> 00:10:36,100
Now close your eyes.

181
00:10:36,183 --> 00:10:37,768
How are you feeling?

182
00:10:37,977 --> 00:10:39,854
I feel...

183
00:10:40,062 --> 00:10:41,397
Really warm.

184
00:10:41,605 --> 00:10:43,440
KATARA: Good, good.

185
00:10:43,649 --> 00:10:45,192
Go on.

186
00:10:45,276 --> 00:10:47,945
Like there's this warm feeling
all around me.

187
00:10:48,028 --> 00:10:49,738
This heat.

188
00:10:50,447 --> 00:10:54,994
Like I'm in the Fire Lord's palace and
he's shooting a bunch of fireballs at me.

189
00:10:55,077 --> 00:10:58,038
And the whole world is being
engulfed in flames.

190
00:10:59,248 --> 00:11:02,126
Maybe your stress is the kind
you need to talk out.

191
00:11:02,209 --> 00:11:03,544
( PANTING )

192
00:11:06,172 --> 00:11:10,467
Why don't you get right down to business
and tell me what's been bothering you?

193
00:11:10,551 --> 00:11:12,136
You know what's bothering me.

194
00:11:12,219 --> 00:11:14,763
I have to fight
the Fire Lord in a few days.

195
00:11:14,847 --> 00:11:19,143
Mm-hmm... Tell me more about this...
Fire Lord.

196
00:11:19,226 --> 00:11:21,687
Why are you so afraid of him?

197
00:11:21,896 --> 00:11:25,107
You said it yourself,
he's the baddest man on the planet.

198
00:11:25,191 --> 00:11:27,651
I'm supposed to defeat him
and save the world.

199
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:31,197
Mmm, life does feel that way
sometimes, doesn't it?

200
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:34,992
Like we're all trying to
save the world from evil?

201
00:11:35,075 --> 00:11:37,077
Okay, but what can I do to feel better?

202
00:11:37,369 --> 00:11:40,456
Wanna try screaming into this pillow?

203
00:11:43,042 --> 00:11:46,045
( MUFFLED SCREAM )

204
00:11:46,587 --> 00:11:47,922
( BAAS )

205
00:11:58,390 --> 00:12:00,100
AZULA: Hello, Zu-zu.

206
00:12:00,184 --> 00:12:03,687
If you've come for a royal hair-combing,
I'm afraid you'll have to wait.

207
00:12:03,896 --> 00:12:06,106
So I guess there's a big
war meeting coming up, huh?

208
00:12:06,232 --> 00:12:07,942
And apparently I'm not welcome there.

209
00:12:08,234 --> 00:12:10,694
What do you mean,
of course you're welcome there.

210
00:12:10,778 --> 00:12:11,820
Oh, yeah?

211
00:12:11,904 --> 00:12:14,365
I guess that's why no one
bothered to tell me about it.

212
00:12:14,531 --> 00:12:17,076
Oh, Zuko, don't be so dramatic.

213
00:12:17,159 --> 00:12:19,119
I'm certain dad wants you there.

214
00:12:19,203 --> 00:12:20,996
You probably just weren't invited

215
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:23,540
because it's so obvious that
you're supposed to be there.

216
00:12:23,624 --> 00:12:25,334
Well, were you invited?

217
00:12:25,417 --> 00:12:27,795
Of course, I'm the princess.

218
00:12:28,003 --> 00:12:29,588
And I'm the prince.

219
00:12:29,797 --> 00:12:33,175
Exactly, so stop acting like
a paranoid child.

220
00:12:33,300 --> 00:12:34,677
Just go to the meeting.

221
00:12:34,885 --> 00:12:36,804
Forget it, I'm not going.

222
00:12:40,349 --> 00:12:43,727
TOPH: All right, what you need is a good
old-fashioned back-pounding

223
00:12:43,811 --> 00:12:45,646
to relieve your stress.

224
00:12:45,729 --> 00:12:47,106
Pound away.

225
00:12:50,818 --> 00:12:52,820
Aah, ow...

226
00:12:53,028 --> 00:12:57,616
Toph, I think this is bruising me.

227
00:12:57,700 --> 00:13:00,661
( GRUNTING )

228
00:13:00,869 --> 00:13:04,039
Sorry, I forgot you have baby skin.

229
00:13:04,373 --> 00:13:07,126
Well, there's one other thing we can try.

230
00:13:09,169 --> 00:13:10,963
Acupuncture.

231
00:13:11,672 --> 00:13:14,341
( SCREAMS )

232
00:13:17,428 --> 00:13:20,014
MAI: Zuko, it's just a dumb meeting.

233
00:13:20,097 --> 00:13:21,515
Who cares?

234
00:13:21,598 --> 00:13:22,850
I don't.

235
00:13:23,058 --> 00:13:25,102
Well, good, you shouldn't.

236
00:13:25,227 --> 00:13:27,313
I mean, why would you even want to go?

237
00:13:27,604 --> 00:13:30,691
Just think about how things went
at the last war meeting you went to.

238
00:13:30,774 --> 00:13:32,985
ZUKO: ( SIGHS ) I know.

239
00:13:33,193 --> 00:13:36,196
You know what will make you feel better?

240
00:13:36,405 --> 00:13:38,407
Ordering some servants around.

241
00:13:38,741 --> 00:13:41,660
I might be hungry for
a whole tray of fruit tarts.

242
00:13:42,161 --> 00:13:45,998
And maybe a little palanquin
ride around town, double-time.

243
00:13:55,132 --> 00:13:57,259
Thanks for everything, guys.

244
00:13:57,343 --> 00:14:00,763
So do you feel less stressed,
ready for a good night's sleep?

245
00:14:00,846 --> 00:14:05,851
Uh, I kind of think I sort of
might slightly feel a little better.

246
00:14:06,060 --> 00:14:07,436
Maybe.

247
00:14:07,519 --> 00:14:10,230
Then our work here is done. ( YAWNS )

248
00:14:10,314 --> 00:14:12,608
( KATARA AND TOPH YAWN )

249
00:14:18,447 --> 00:14:22,159
( THUNDER CRASHING )

250
00:14:22,368 --> 00:14:24,745
( CHATTERING )

251
00:14:32,419 --> 00:14:34,254
( DISTORTED VOICE )

252
00:14:42,721 --> 00:14:45,099
( SCREAMING )

253
00:14:48,102 --> 00:14:49,895
( GRUNTS )

254
00:14:53,023 --> 00:14:56,151
( OZAI CACKLING )

255
00:14:56,485 --> 00:14:58,278
( SCREAMS )

256
00:15:15,045 --> 00:15:16,713
Shh...

257
00:15:22,761 --> 00:15:24,596
( SCREAMS )

258
00:15:25,222 --> 00:15:27,224
( ROARS )

259
00:15:27,808 --> 00:15:29,393
What happened, Aang?

260
00:15:29,601 --> 00:15:30,936
It's the nightmares.

261
00:15:31,019 --> 00:15:33,063
They just get worse and worse.

262
00:15:33,147 --> 00:15:36,024
Looks like it's time
for another therapy session.

263
00:15:36,733 --> 00:15:38,735
No, that won't help.

264
00:15:38,819 --> 00:15:40,195
Nothing helps.

265
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:42,364
There's only one thing I can do.

266
00:15:42,531 --> 00:15:45,117
I'm gonna stay awake straight
through to the invasion.

267
00:15:55,586 --> 00:15:57,087
Invasion...

268
00:15:57,171 --> 00:15:59,715
All aboard for the invasion.

269
00:15:59,798 --> 00:16:01,717
You don't look so good.

270
00:16:01,925 --> 00:16:04,595
You sure you can't just lie down
for a little nap?

271
00:16:04,887 --> 00:16:07,598
I told you, I can't go back to sleep.

272
00:16:07,806 --> 00:16:10,309
Aang, staying up all night
can't be good for you.

273
00:16:10,517 --> 00:16:13,979
Actually, staying up all night
has given me some time to think.

274
00:16:14,188 --> 00:16:16,356
And I've realized some big things, Katara.

275
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:17,941
What big things?

276
00:16:18,233 --> 00:16:20,194
I see everything so clearly now.

277
00:16:20,277 --> 00:16:23,405
What really matters,
why I'm really doing this.

278
00:16:23,614 --> 00:16:26,283
I'm doing it to save the world,
but more than that...

279
00:16:26,492 --> 00:16:28,410
I'm doing it for the people I love.

280
00:16:28,619 --> 00:16:30,829
I'm doing it for you, Katara.

281
00:16:31,038 --> 00:16:33,123
Aang, what are you saying?

282
00:16:33,332 --> 00:16:36,001
I'm saying... I love you.

283
00:16:45,552 --> 00:16:47,137
What are we doing?

284
00:16:47,221 --> 00:16:50,891
What our hearts have been telling us
to do for a long, long time.

285
00:16:51,099 --> 00:16:53,685
Baby, you're my forever girl.

286
00:16:54,311 --> 00:16:55,646
KATARA: Aang...

287
00:16:55,729 --> 00:16:56,897
Uh?

288
00:16:57,147 --> 00:17:00,150
I was just saying
you should take a nap.

289
00:17:00,609 --> 00:17:03,904
Oh, I guess
kind of drifted off into a daydream.

290
00:17:04,488 --> 00:17:06,240
What was your dream about?

291
00:17:07,574 --> 00:17:09,618
Uh, living underwater.

292
00:17:10,285 --> 00:17:11,620
Sounds neat.

293
00:17:11,787 --> 00:17:13,413
( CHUCKLES )

294
00:17:14,081 --> 00:17:15,207
Whew.

295
00:17:19,586 --> 00:17:22,339
Prince Zuko, everyone's
waiting for you.

296
00:17:22,506 --> 00:17:23,840
What?

297
00:17:24,007 --> 00:17:25,342
The high admirals, high generals,

298
00:17:25,425 --> 00:17:27,344
the war ministers,
and the princess have all arrived.

299
00:17:27,469 --> 00:17:29,012
You're the only person missing.

300
00:17:29,346 --> 00:17:32,474
So... My dad wants me at the meeting?

301
00:17:32,683 --> 00:17:35,227
The Fire Lord said he would not
start until you arrived, sir.

302
00:17:43,402 --> 00:17:44,444
( EXHALES )

303
00:17:44,528 --> 00:17:47,322
Put 'em up, Fire Lord.

304
00:17:50,909 --> 00:17:52,911
( YELLS )

305
00:17:53,036 --> 00:17:55,122
Hey, I'm trying to build
Appa some armor here

306
00:17:55,205 --> 00:17:57,332
so he doesn't have to go
into the invasion naked.

307
00:17:57,499 --> 00:17:58,875
He's your bison.

308
00:17:59,084 --> 00:18:00,669
Ozai's defense is impeccable.

309
00:18:00,752 --> 00:18:03,463
I'll have to try a different approach.

310
00:18:03,797 --> 00:18:05,632
( YELLS )

311
00:18:12,973 --> 00:18:15,934
You think you're untouchable,
don't you, Mr. Fire Lord?

312
00:18:16,018 --> 00:18:19,021
VOICE: Boy, you are really
starting to lose it, kid.

313
00:18:20,063 --> 00:18:22,983
Momo, did you hear something?

314
00:18:23,859 --> 00:18:26,403
VOICE: No, but I said something.

315
00:18:26,612 --> 00:18:28,113
Uh...

316
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:31,408
You, my friend, are just a few
plums short of a fruit pie.

317
00:18:36,496 --> 00:18:39,207
( CHATTERING )

318
00:18:40,626 --> 00:18:42,252
That's more like it.

319
00:18:42,461 --> 00:18:45,756
I'm so tired that for a second there,
I imagined you were talking to me.

320
00:18:45,964 --> 00:18:47,215
( CHATTERS )

321
00:18:47,424 --> 00:18:49,968
Oh, Momo, let me explain.

322
00:18:50,052 --> 00:18:53,096
( CHATTERING )

323
00:18:53,430 --> 00:18:55,807
( MOMO CHATTERING )

324
00:18:56,016 --> 00:18:59,978
( LAUGHING, CHATTERING )

325
00:19:00,062 --> 00:19:01,438
KATARA: Aang?

326
00:19:01,688 --> 00:19:04,399
We're all starting to get
a little worried about you.

327
00:19:05,108 --> 00:19:06,902
You've been awake too long.

328
00:19:07,110 --> 00:19:09,863
And you're acting downright weird.

329
00:19:10,197 --> 00:19:12,574
You've got to take care of yourself.

330
00:19:12,658 --> 00:19:15,118
You can't go on like this.

331
00:19:15,410 --> 00:19:18,830
( GROANS ) Look, I appreciate
what you guys are saying

332
00:19:18,914 --> 00:19:21,041
but the stress and the nightmares...

333
00:19:21,333 --> 00:19:23,085
They were just too much.

334
00:19:23,293 --> 00:19:25,587
Staying awake is the best way
for me to deal with it.

335
00:19:25,796 --> 00:19:27,881
Yeah, leave the kid alone.

336
00:19:28,090 --> 00:19:30,050
Hey, who asked you?

337
00:19:30,258 --> 00:19:32,344
AANG: Guys, come on.

338
00:19:32,511 --> 00:19:34,763
No, I am sick of this guy

339
00:19:34,846 --> 00:19:37,182
always mouthing off
and telling me what to do.

340
00:19:37,265 --> 00:19:38,809
Oh, you don't like it?

341
00:19:38,892 --> 00:19:40,310
Well, let's go right now.

342
00:19:40,519 --> 00:19:42,688
Sokka, what should we do?

343
00:19:42,771 --> 00:19:43,855
About what?

344
00:19:43,980 --> 00:19:45,399
About that.

345
00:19:54,700 --> 00:19:57,703
( ROARING )

346
00:19:57,786 --> 00:19:59,621
( SCREECHING )

347
00:19:59,830 --> 00:20:01,039
( SWORDS CLANG )

348
00:20:05,877 --> 00:20:08,255
Appa, Appa, Appa.

349
00:20:08,338 --> 00:20:10,882
Momo, Momo, Momo.

350
00:20:19,933 --> 00:20:23,603
Come on, guys, we're all
on the same side.

351
00:20:23,687 --> 00:20:27,941
♪ Chakras, chakras,
everybody loves chakras ♪

352
00:20:28,024 --> 00:20:30,694
♪ Chakras, chakras ♪

353
00:20:30,777 --> 00:20:33,405
♪ Chakra sandwich
tastes good, yum... ♪

354
00:20:38,702 --> 00:20:41,288
Yay, yay, yay, yay, yay!

355
00:20:43,790 --> 00:20:46,334
( WHIMPERS )

356
00:20:51,256 --> 00:20:52,716
( CHEERING )

357
00:21:01,391 --> 00:21:03,560
I just need to jump in
a cold waterfall.

358
00:21:03,769 --> 00:21:06,563
( SCREAMING )

359
00:21:13,528 --> 00:21:15,655
So how did it go?

360
00:21:15,739 --> 00:21:18,992
When I got to the meeting,
everyone welcomed me.

361
00:21:19,451 --> 00:21:21,286
My father had saved me a seat.

362
00:21:21,369 --> 00:21:23,038
He wanted me next to him.

363
00:21:23,121 --> 00:21:25,540
I was literally at his right hand.

364
00:21:25,624 --> 00:21:27,501
Zuko, that's wonderful.

365
00:21:27,584 --> 00:21:30,045
You must be happy.

366
00:21:35,008 --> 00:21:38,220
During the meeting,
I was the perfect prince.

367
00:21:39,095 --> 00:21:41,556
The son my father wanted.

368
00:21:41,765 --> 00:21:44,226
But I wasn't me.

369
00:22:00,659 --> 00:22:03,203
Oh, look, another hallucination.

370
00:22:03,286 --> 00:22:05,539
An imaginary bed made out of clouds.

371
00:22:05,622 --> 00:22:07,123
TOPH: Hey, it's real.

372
00:22:07,332 --> 00:22:09,042
We spent hours working on it.

373
00:22:09,125 --> 00:22:10,252
We made it for you.

374
00:22:10,418 --> 00:22:12,629
A good night's sleep will
probably take the crazy away.

375
00:22:12,712 --> 00:22:13,922
We hope.

376
00:22:14,047 --> 00:22:17,175
Look, you guys keep telling me
I need to sleep, but I can't.

377
00:22:17,259 --> 00:22:19,135
The invasion's tomorrow.

378
00:22:19,302 --> 00:22:20,387
Aang...

379
00:22:20,470 --> 00:22:23,014
No, Katara, there's still
so much I haven't learned.

380
00:22:23,181 --> 00:22:26,226
I don't need sleep,
what I need is practice.

381
00:22:26,309 --> 00:22:28,436
Quick, hit me.

382
00:22:28,645 --> 00:22:30,105
I'm not going to hit you.

383
00:22:30,313 --> 00:22:31,606
You want me to do it?

384
00:22:31,815 --> 00:22:33,483
Listen to me.

385
00:22:33,567 --> 00:22:35,777
You've been training for this
since the day we met.

386
00:22:35,986 --> 00:22:37,696
I've seen your progress.

387
00:22:37,904 --> 00:22:39,906
You're smart, brave, and strong enough.

388
00:22:40,115 --> 00:22:41,950
You really think so?

389
00:22:42,158 --> 00:22:43,577
We all do.

390
00:22:43,660 --> 00:22:45,912
You can do this, you're ready.

391
00:22:45,996 --> 00:22:48,498
You're the man, twinkle toes.

392
00:22:48,790 --> 00:22:50,625
Thanks, guys.

393
00:22:52,794 --> 00:22:54,504
( YAWNS )

394
00:22:58,258 --> 00:23:00,093
( YAWNS )

395
00:23:00,302 --> 00:23:01,970
You know what?

396
00:23:02,178 --> 00:23:04,598
I think I am ready.

397
00:23:12,772 --> 00:23:15,275
Your days of tyranny are over, Fire Lord.

398
00:23:15,483 --> 00:23:18,236
Really, you're going to take me out?

399
00:23:18,445 --> 00:23:20,655
You're not even wearing pants.

400
00:23:21,239 --> 00:23:24,492
No, Fire Lord Ozai,
you're not wearing pants.

401
00:23:25,201 --> 00:23:27,746
( GASPS, SCREAMS )

402
00:23:27,996 --> 00:23:29,539
No!

403
00:23:29,623 --> 00:23:32,584
My royal parts are showing.

404
00:23:32,792 --> 00:23:35,211
( OZAI SCREAMS )

405
00:23:47,557 --> 00:23:51,061
( ♪ )
